WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:07.419
Start separate conversations for different topics.

2
00:00:07.499 --> 00:00:11.798
Click New Chat Session, enter your question and continue your discussion.

3
00:00:11.878 --> 00:00:15.937
Use the available history features to revisit previous conversations.

4
00:00:16.017 --> 00:00:20.376
Inside Creator AI, keeping separate sessions prevents resume brainstorming

5
00:00:20.456 --> 00:00:23.615
from mixing with certificate design or interview prep.

6
00:00:23.695 --> 00:00:28.174
View your saved conversation threads in the session sidebar whenever you are

7
00:00:28.254 --> 00:00:32.613
signed in, switch between active contexts with one click, or start a clean

8
00:00:32.693 --> 00:00:34.713
slate by pressing New Chat Session.

9
00:00:34.793 --> 00:00:39.152
Every message stays organized by topic so you can jump back in days later,

10
00:00:39.232 --> 00:00:43.830
pick up your discussion right where you paused, and review previous AI answers

11
00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:45.430
anytime.

12
00:00:45.510 --> 00:00:47.030
Thank you for watching.
